+          <div class="art art--wide art--violet" data-slot="blog/how-to-turn-a-business-idea-into-a-market-ready-digital-product/cover"><span class="art__mark" style="font-size:96px">🗺️</span><span class="art__cap">Product Strategy · Code &amp; Canvas</span></div>
