+          <div class="art art--wide art--violet" data-slot="blog/why-software-development-alone-wont-solve-your-business-problems/cover"><span class="art__mark" style="font-size:96px">🚧</span><span class="art__cap">Product Strategy · Code &amp; Canvas</span></div>
